        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f9e9921e-0075-53e7-8658-38a9793956b4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lari White, Chuck Cannon, Vicky McGehee, Danny Gokey\n- Songs/Albums: \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\", My Best Days\n- Organizations/Shows/Charts: American Idol, You Can Be a Star, The Nashville Network, Hot Country Songs\n\nFacts:\n- Lari White was born on May 13, 1965, and she is an American country music artist and actress.\n- In 1988, Lari White first gained national attention as a winner on \"You Can Be a Star,\" a talent competition that aired on The Nashville Network.\n- Danny Gokey was a finalist on season 8 of American Idol.\n- \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\" was written by Lari White, Chuck Cannon, and Vicky McGehee, and it was recorded by Danny Gokey.\n- \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\" and the second single from the album My Best Days both made the Top 40 on Hot Country Songs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
